# Leyline of Transformation: "If this card is in your opening hand, you may begin the game with it on the battlefield" (CR 103.6a). Bot1 accepts and, as it
# enters, chooses Merfolk (CR 614.12a); creatures Bot1 controls and creature cards it owns off the battlefield are Merfolk besides their other types (CR 613.1d,
# 205.1b): the Llanowar Elves it casts on turn 1 and the Doomed Traveler still in its hand. Bot2's own Doomed Traveler is not Bot1's, and keeps its types alone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Leyline of Transformation
Llanowar Elves
Doomed Traveler
Forest
Island x3
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Doomed Traveler
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Modes(Merfolk)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Leyline of Transformation.ChosenSubtype = Merfolk
? Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Subtypes = Druid; Elf; Merfolk
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Subtypes = Druid; Elf; Merfolk
Bot1.Hand.Doomed Traveler.Subtypes = Human; Merfolk; Soldier
Bot2.Hand.Doomed Traveler.Subtypes = Human; Soldier
Bot1.Battlefield.Leyline of Transformation.Subtypes = (absent)
